WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Install and restart. Ernesto detects the
existing project test command.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Check project runs npm run test directly. No
helper paths or project JSON.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Details shows actual command output. Exit zero
does not verify test counts.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A source edit makes the earlier command input
comparison stale.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Check project runs again and really fails. Exit
status remains separate from freshness.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Quiet hides the banter while preserving the
evidence and controls.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Restore banter and offer chocolate. The failed
result stays failed.
